# Build context of infra/live-job.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside it,
# in place of the root .dockerignore): the lock, the code and the staged clip and checkpoint, nothing
# else. The repo's other clips, runs and answer keys never reach the build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!ninety/**
!runs/live-input/clip/index.jsonl
!runs/live-input/clip/images/*.jpg
!runs/live-input/checkpoint/checkpoint_best_total.pth
!runs/live-input/checkpoint/train-manifest.json
**/__pycache__
